gold rush has been on the air for over a  decade and cast members have come and  gone would you believe teenagers had  outclassed miners three times their age  you're the most successful gold rush  characters ranked  former army medic fred lewis first  appeared on parker schnabel's spin-off  series gold rush parker's trail he was  hired to replace schnabel's former  operator rick ness on a dangerous  expedition into papua new guinea he  joined the main show in season 11 as he  and his rookie team sought to take  advantage of the record high prices of  gold and record low prices of oil  brought on by the kovan 19 pandemic  we're not just looking to have a good  season i want to make the lewis  family name in the madden family name  well known despite being an impressively  bearded and patriotic group of would-be  miners lewis and his crew lacked the  aptitude and ability to learn skills  that would save their season even a  visit from series fixer freddie dodge  wasn't able to get team lewis back on  track  in the end the lewis crew's total yield  was just 6.4 ounces with a worth of  about 11 400 the team earned less than  half of what the hoffman crew mined in  their first season despite his failures  lewis has returned for season 12 as well  as the 2021 limited series gold rush  winter's fortune will his luck improve  with experience only time will tell  veteran minor and quarry expert dave  turin was brought in in season one to  assist his friend todd hoffman's  fledgling attempts at finding gold for  three years he assisted the hoffman crew  and was integral to their continued  success after hoffman's ill-fated  expedition into guyana in season 4 turin  ended their partnership and teamed up  with freddie dodge on a new mining  operation in the klondike in season 5  hoffman convinced turin to rejoin his  crew in exchange for a 50 ownership  stake in hoffman's new claim in 2019 he  starred in the gold rush spin-off dave  turin's lost minds traveling across the  country and rehabilitating abandoned  gold mines  since he was never a crew leader on gold  rush his gold yields were not tallied  however the hard work he completed with  the hoffman crew and the fact that he  extended the gold rush franchise with  his own spin-off earns him a place on  this list  when miners are in trouble they call  freddy dodge much like his colleague  dave turin dodge was on hand to assist  the hoffman crew in its first two  seasons before joining them full time in  season three after leaving hoffman  behind in guyana to work a klondike  claim with his brother dodge returned to  the hoffman crew in season 5 and has  appeared off and on ever since he's  often called to assist in particularly  dire moments such as rick ness's  collapsing wash plant in season 9 or  fred lewis's failing crew in season 11.  in 2021 dodge hosted the six episode  special freddie dodge's mine rescue  visiting underperforming gold mines  across the country and getting them back  on track  lots of gold in this country the old  timers hit it pretty hard you know they  found lots of large nuggets  like dave turin dodge's gold yields on  the show have not been tallied however  his trusted place within every crew he  works with along with his success as an  ambassador of the gold rush brand earns  him a place among the show's most  successful cast members  miners fred hurt and his son dustin  better known as the dakota boys were  introduced in season one they became  regular cast members in season two and  they leased the porcupine creek mine out  from under todd hoffman after he missed  a lease payment free to mine the claim  as they please the dakota boys attempted  to reach the glory hole a gold rich  deposit at the bottom of a water-filled  ravine which jack hoffman had previously  gone after the work on the glory hole  was beset with problems from a decaying  cabin on their dig site to the threat of  major flooding due to melting snow caps  on a nearby mountain the dakota 